      en: ["First mentioned in 1253 in the Courland partition treaties", "Birthplace of the prominent painter Janis Rozentāls (1866–1916)", "The local Lutheran church construction began in 1737", "Production of Gotiņa milk sweets started here in 1960", "The Saldus Saule music festival has been held since 1987", "Officially granted city rights in 1917 during WWI"],
