      en: ["Founded in 1971 as part of a local agricultural collective.", "Uses only grain grown on Agrofirma Tērvete's own agricultural lands.", "Water is sourced from artesian wells at a depth exceeding 100 meters.", "Beer maturation lasts up to 45 days depending on the specific variety.", "The company maintains a significant breeding program for the Latvian horse breed.", "Consistently awarded the Latvian 'Quality Product' label for food excellence."],
